__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.superpowers/
.worktrees/
.DS_Store
.env
results.json
experiments/*/
experiments/.*-/
# Retained measurement evidence. Scoped to this one directory on purpose: a
# broader negation would re-include the ~10,400-event route traces and the
# 580 MB artifact. Must stay AFTER the excludes -- git will not descend into an
# excluded directory, so a negation placed before them is silently ignored.
!experiments/baselines/
# Arena run/import staging directories live under the retained baseline root.
experiments/baselines/.*/
# The one repo-relative scratch root every phase-2 operator command writes to.
# This repository documents Windows 11 / PowerShell as its platform, where
# $TMPDIR expands to the empty string -- a smoke command pinned to "$TMPDIR/x"
# silently writes to the drive root instead of failing. Pinning one relative
# path removes the shell dependency and keeps smoke artifacts out of git status.
.scratch/
data/catalog.jsonl
data/*.artifacts/
data/releases/
# Organizer-only code, private evaluation data, manifests, and build reports.
organizer/
secure/
# Internal provenance and release-audit working documents.
docs/audits/
docs/data_selection_audit.md
docs/participant_release_checklist.md
# Organizer-only pipeline tests.
tests/test_5core_builder.py
tests/test_organizer_pipeline.py
*.log
